fixture_id: B-relationship-change
category: relationship_change
scenario: New evidence changes the relationship among known activities
starting_context: Accepted software service and advisory practice
active_context: Identity candidate lists both activities without their operating relationship
user_stimulus: Advisory work is how we discover the product problems we later solve in the service
passing_behaviors: Re-evaluate the relationship; state a provisional supported connection; reflect user correction if supplied
failing_behaviors: Repeat both facts without connection; assert unsupported causality; force the connection into another domain
rubric_dimensions: contextual_re_evaluation constructive_contribution convergence_timing contribution_opportunity authority_boundary conversational_presence
governance_references: Profile; Experience Standard; Constitution
hard_failures: unsupported accepted fact; premature acceptance
